ems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3284200,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3284200-1846651706690965","game_id":"steam-3284200","kind":"announcement","title":"Muri: Wildwoods is in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hello again fellow Muri ♡✧*̥˚ Pelle is in Steam Next Fest! *̥˚✧Support the devs by playing!The best thing you can do to help us keep working on Pelle's adventures is to play the demo this Next Fest and share it with a friend you think would like to play it. Playing the demo during Next Fest will help Steam spread Pelle to more murii out there :DBring your Demo save to Release!Opening the demo now will prompt the final deletion of saves, from now on you will be able to play the demo and bring you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:04:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690965","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3284200-1846018067930071","game_id":"steam-3284200","kind":"update","title":"Steam Next Fest Demo Update!","summary":"ヾ(•ω•`)~ Hello fellow Murii Hope you've all marked your calendars for the release on December 7th this year! We're back again with some fun news...The Next Fest Demo update is here! We've released the update a bit early to fix any final bugs and give a bit of early access to all you lovely players in our community! We'll be sending out another update right before the 19th to get you as good a demo as possible for Next Fest of course! So, what's in it?🤸‍♀️ Pelle can now roll!After plenty of feedb","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T15:06:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930071","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3284200-1844751498234937","game_id":"steam-3284200","kind":"announcement","title":"Muri: Wildwoods Releases December 7th 2026 ♡","summary":"Hello fellow murii,We have the biggest of announcements...✧*̥˚ Muri: Wildwoods is coming to Steam this December 7th, 2026 *̥˚✧↙ Watch the release date reveal trailer here ↘BIG thanks to our friends at Coffee Stain Studios for showcasing our game in the Big Break Showcase. Please do check out some more cool games, news, and reveals in the full event: https://store.steampowered.com/curator/46193397-The-Big-Break-Showcase/This December you will finally be able to explore Pelle's entire journey on t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T17:05:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234937","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3284200-1844115010489459","game_id":"steam-3284200","kind":"announcement","title":"Muri: Wildwoods breaks out a BIG announcement on The Big Break Showcase Sep 29!","summary":"Hello fellow murii!Hear our announcement of the announcement: September 29th we will let you know our ```releasedate´´´ in the Big Break showcase hosted by Coffee Stain Studios. In this showcase we’ll be joined by a bunch of friends, big and small, quirky and weird, but certainly not normal or pedestrian. Showcase will air on Coffee Stains YouTube September 29th. Mark. Your. Calendars!!! :DDDSee you later this month!The Speldosa Team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T15:29:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010489459","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3284200-1834602721187787","game_id":"steam-3284200","kind":"update","title":"☀ Sun's Out Demo Update Out Today!","summary":"Hello Murii! ･ﾟﾟ･｡Amazing news! The Sun's Out Demo Update is out today ☀️ In this update, we've focused on adding new lighting to the demo as well as a fresh new ui style! You'll also find a new critter and some new artwork from Pelle, along with bug fixes and some other small changes - have fun!🎨 Visual Updates!🐍 A New Critter!✍️ New Pelle Sketches!🐛 Bugfixes & more!IMPORTANTSave files are cleansed with this update in order for the game to work as intended. Patch Notes Demo V0.1.6NEW5 sketches ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T15:00:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721187787","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3284200-1826362059924732","game_id":"steam-3284200","kind":"update","title":"Small Demo Update & Women's Day Celebration!","summary":"Hello Muri, we're baaack! ･ﾟﾟ･｡We're here with some necessary, but also some fun updates to the demo, like interactions with the Squarks. Find patch notes at the bottom of this post. We can't thank you enough for the great reviews and all the thoughts and feedback you've shared with us. It's invaluable ♡Leave a review!If you played and enjoyed the demo, please leave a review and wishlist the game, it helps a small dev like us a ton! ⤵Celebrate Women's Day!Anyway, we're also part of the Women's D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-06T16:00:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059924732","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3284200-1825727806711021","game_id":"steam-3284200","kind":"announcement","title":"The Muri: Wildwoods Demo is live!!","summary":"The Demo is live on Steam!Hey Murii ˚ ｡⋆Today is the day, the demo for Muri: Wildwoods is now live on Steam. Please let us know what you think by Leaving a Review or report bugs and feedback in the Steam Discussions!We're so happy to finally let you all arrive at the Wildwoods island and step into the paws of the muri Pelle. We want to continue working on this game with all of your feedback, thoughts, and ideas in mind so please do share them with us in our Steam Hub. If you want to support us f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-27T15:09:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806711021","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3284200-1825093633185842","game_id":"steam-3284200","kind":"announcement","title":"The Muri: Wildwoods Demo is coming February 27th to Steam","summary":"Hello Murii, exciting news!!The Demo is coming to Steam 27th Feb!Step into the paws of the muri PelleIn the demo, you'll step into the paws of Pelle, a muri who finds themselves on their first ever solo-mission. With support from their cleaning crew via the DigiDial app TeamSqueak, Pelle will explore, clean, and restore a beach! Pelle is somewhat of an artisteAs you traverse the beach you've landed on, Pelle will draw sketches for you to collect and upload in your DigiDial. Pelle is maybe not th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-19T18:03:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633185842","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3284200-1816307528974154","game_id":"steam-3284200","kind":"announcement","title":"New Gameplay Trailer for Muri: Wildwoods! ˚ ｡⋆","summary":"✧*̥˚ NEW GAMEPLAY FOOTAGE *̥˚✧We’re a party of Cozy Quest this year! To celebrate, we’re releasing a new gameplay trailer showing you all some never seen footage of Muri: Wildwoods. Give it a look ⬇️ Development UpdatesOver the past few months, we’ve been focusing on:⚙️Iterating on some areas in the gameWe have already shown off some of this on our other platforms, most recently the beach area! We've been working on giving this area a glow-up, both visually and from a gameplay perspective as wel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-18T16:58:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816307528974154","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3284200-1808601382411521","game_id":"steam-3284200","kind":"announcement","title":"You can now Playtest Muri: Wildwoods! ˚ ｡⋆","summary":"✧*̥˚ IT’S TIME! *̥˚✧You can now playtest Muri: Wildwoods here on Steam!!!Some info📅 The playtest is open to play from today the 20th of August until September 3rd. Make sure to get yourself, your family, your friends, your nephew and niece, signed up before this Sunday the 24th when the signups close. If you’re already signed up before this date you will, as mentioned above, still be able to playtest the game in piece until the 3rd of September. ⚠️ This is a playtest of Muri: Wildwoods, not a de","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-20T13:45:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1808601382411521","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3284200-1807966710818174","game_id":"steam-3284200","kind":"announcement","title":"˚✧ Muri: Wildwoods Playtest happening next week!","summary":"Hello, fellow Murii!We’re back with some super exciting news. You know that playtest we’ve been promising... It’s finally happening!!!Our Steam Playtest will go live on Wednesday, the 20th of August! Sign up for the Playtest now on our Steampage, Wishlist the game while you’re at it, so you don’t miss out on the full release, Follow to know when our demo goes live, grab a nice cup of your favorite hot beverage, and wait for Wednesday to arrive ☕ 📺 Feedback, Screenshots, Videos, and Streams are v","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-13T15:01:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807966710818174","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3284200-1793384379378149","game_id":"steam-3284200","kind":"announcement","title":"✧ ˚ Sign up for Playtest!","summary":"Hello, fellow Murii! Exciting news! This week we're part of WINGS Women's Day Sale on Steam, and tonight (March 6th at 4 PM PT / 7 PM ET), we’ll be featured in the Women-Led Games Showcase on IGN, GameSpot, and WLG Youtube! We’re so happy to see games by women being celebrated—especially since half our team is made up of women and non-binary devs! If you haven’t already, check out some of the amazing games in the event—and don’t miss our trailer on the big screen! 😁 Sign up for playtesting! To c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-06T16:46:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1793384379378149","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3284200-1785321795646093","game_id":"steam-3284200","kind":"announcement","title":"✧ ˚ Announcing Muri: Wildwoods!","summary":"Hello fellow Murii! It's only been a few weeks since Projec